# Completion Three-Gate Discipline

## "Complete" requires three independent confirmations in the same report

1. **Commit hash on main**
   - Format: `<hash> on main` (or document explicit uncommitted state per GAP 12)
   - Push verified: `git ls-remote origin main` matches local

2. **Deploy confirmation**
   - GREEN server `git rev-parse HEAD` matches commit hash exactly
   - Container rebuild/restart confirmed if backend/bridge touched
   - `cat /var/www/sovereignsanctuary-web/version.json` shows new hash if Flutter touched

3. **End-to-end production test**
   - Real user (or audit test user) interacts through real UI surface
   - Expected outcome verified via screenshot, log entry, OR audit row in PG
   - "Linter passed" and "build succeeded" are NOT E2E tests

## Forbidden patterns
- "Complete" reported with code written but not committed
- "Complete" reported with commit on main but no GREEN verification
- "Complete" reported with deploy verified but no production-UI smoke test

## Why
2026-05-11 View Brief pill: reported complete; was uncommitted in local working tree across multiple Cursor sessions. CoachN couldn't reach Sensitive Profile screen from production Coach Command for ~24 hours after "completion" was reported.
